Third-party frontend components
===============================

GophishFR distributions include third-party browser libraries under their own
terms. Their versions, provenance, licenses, usage, and known security status
are documented in docs/FRONTEND_VENDOR_INVENTORY.md. Generated bundles retain
available license banners, and complete notices for package-managed frontend
libraries are emitted beside the generated JavaScript bundles.

The package-managed components in the generated frontend vendor bundle include
jQuery, Bootstrap, Popper, Chart.js, @kurkle/color,
chartjs-plugin-zoom, Hammer.JS, DataTables, Moment.js, Papa Parse,
and UAParser.js under the MIT License. The same bundle includes Tom Select and
its `@orchidjs/sifter` and `@orchidjs/unicode-variants` dependencies under the
Apache License, Version 2.0. Their complete copyright and license
notices, including the full Apache License text, are distributed in
`static/js/dist/vendor.min.js.LICENSE.txt`. Manually
retained browser libraries in that bundle preserve their available source
license banners and are inventoried in `docs/FRONTEND_VENDOR_INVENTORY.md`.

The HTML source editor bundle includes CodeMirror 6, Lezer, and their small
support packages under the MIT License. Complete package-specific copyright and
license notices are distributed in
`static/js/dist/app/html_editor.min.js.LICENSE.txt`.

Historical attribution (no longer distributed)
===============================================

The following components were previously distributed by GophishFR or its
upstream Gophish project, but are no longer included in current builds or
releases. Their attribution is preserved here for historical completeness.

Flat UI Free 2.1.3 (modified derivative)
-----------------------------------------

The repository previously contained `static/css/flat-ui.css`, a locally
modified derivative of Flat UI Free 2.1.3 by Designmodo (Sergey Shmidt,
Sergii Iurevych, Dmitry Pytkin). It was imported into Gophish in commit
`9b216c54669598ecfc4bd07ea9439eaabf4fc44e` from:

    https://github.com/designmodo/Flat-UI/tree/097631e59b9950312052123a65cbcbaf97dc740a

Flat UI Free was distributed under the Creative Commons Attribution 3.0
Unported and MIT licenses:

    https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/3.0/
    https://opensource.org/license/mit

It was removed during the Bootstrap 5 migration and replaced by the
first-party `static/css/gophishfr-theme.css`. Its full history is preserved
in the repository's git log.

The distributed `static/css/checkbox.css` is a modified derivative of Awesome
Bootstrap Checkbox 0.3.6:

    Copyright (c) 2014 flatlogic.com
    https://github.com/flatlogic/awesome-bootstrap-checkbox

It is distributed under the MIT License. The permission and warranty terms are
reproduced in the root LICENSE file.

The distributed Datamaps browser code is derived from Datamaps:

    Copyright (c) 2012 Mark DiMarco
    https://github.com/markmarkoh/datamaps

It is distributed under the MIT License. Its exact historical build is
unknown; this limitation is documented in the frontend inventory.

Highcharts is not distributed by GophishFR. Its historical removal and
replacement are recorded in the frontend inventory.

Select2 is no longer distributed by GophishFR. It was removed in favour of
native `<select>` controls and Tom Select for the multi-select group picker.
Its historical removal is recorded in the frontend inventory.
